      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This report is still waiting for more info! We've identified that AAP values aren't appearing correctly in the avatar debug UI, but otherwise our testing so far suggests that they're being applied to the avatar's animator as expected. Recent comments suggest that there's a case where the animator is unable to pick up these values when used in a certain way, but we haven't yet been able to reproduce this.\n\nIf you're being affected by this issue, please feel free to share information about your setup to help us make sure we've fully resolved the problem for you. Thank you!",
